# RDX, the same single point with samQEq supplying the charges: ReaxFF's own charge step is disabled
# (checkqeq no) and fix qeq/sam solves with ReaxFF's electronegativities, hardnesses and shielding
# parameters (rdx.param, from make_params.py), the cube-root kernel, the same taper to 10 A and one
# global neutrality constraint. `cutoff on` selects the taper-cutoff operator with no reciprocal part.
# coul/long and pppm/samqeq are present only because the long-range route reads g_ewald from the kspace
# style, and both are switched off (`compute no`); with the fix's own energy excluded, pe and the forces
# are those of ReaxFF alone. Omitting any of the three leaves the charges right and pe and forces wrong.
units           real
atom_style      charge
read_data       data.rdx
